<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARIAN O/N RATES EASE TO 22.625 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARIAN O/N RATES EASE TO 22.625 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight interest ended lower on Monday at 22.625 percent, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Rates began at 22.875 percent then eased in slow trade,&quot; said Erika Kaiser of Budapest Bank, adding that the pattern was typical of a new reserve period.</p>
<p>&quot;With a new reserve period beginning there's plenty of money on the market,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>Overnight rates ended last week at 23 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +361 327 4040</p>
</text>
